{"name":"Bat-Signal","hex":"#feff00","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Bat-Signal","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A thing which serves to attract or summon something."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Bat-Signal"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bat-Signal","blocks":[{"text":"The Bat-Signal is a distress signal device appearing in American comic books published by DC Comics, as a means to summon the superhero Batman. It is a specially modified searchlight with a stylized emblem of a bat affixed to the light, allowing it to project a large bat symbol onto cloudy night skies over Gotham City."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/f/f1/Bat-Signal.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bat-Signal","wikidata":"Q890714"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/0f/Bat-Signal_%28Detective_Comics_60%2C_February_1942%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/0f/Bat-Signal_%28Detective_Comics_60%2C_February_1942%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"The Bat-Signal's debut in Detective Comics #60 (February 1942).","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABat-Signal_(Detective_Comics_60%2C_February_1942).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/da/Bat-Signal%27s_projection_over_Gotham_City.jpg/250px-Bat-Signal%27s_projection_over_Gotham_City.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/da/Bat-Signal%27s_projection_over_Gotham_City.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/da/Bat-Signal%27s_projection_over_Gotham_City.jpg/250px-Bat-Signal%27s_projection_over_Gotham_City.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Bat-Signal's projection displaying onto the skies above Gotham City from its police department headquarters, summons Batman, provides hope to its people, and intimidates criminal elements. From Batman: Legends of the Dark Knight #6 (April 1990). Art by Klaus Janson.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABat-Signal's_projection_over_Gotham_City.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/c6/Bat-signal_1989_film.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/c6/Bat-signal_1989_film.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"The Bat-Signal as it appears in the 1989 film Batman","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABat-signal_1989_film.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d1/Bat-Signal_%28Batman_v._Superman-Dawn_of_Justice%29..jpg/250px-Bat-Signal_%28Batman_v._Superman-Dawn_of_Justice%29..jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/d1/Bat-Signal_%28Batman_v._Superman-Dawn_of_Justice%29..jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d1/Bat-Signal_%28Batman_v._Superman-Dawn_of_Justice%29..jpg/250px-Bat-Signal_%28Batman_v._Superman-Dawn_of_Justice%29..jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Bat-Signal in the 2016 film Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice, with Ben Affleck (left) as Batman","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABat-Signal_(Batman_v._Superman-Dawn_of_Justice)..jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/c/c1/Bat-Signal_%28Batman_The_Animated_Series%29.jpg/330px-Bat-Signal_%28Batman_The_Animated_Series%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedi